{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024170100196-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024170100\"/><p>震央與西藏接壤地區極為接近。</p><p>中國地震台網正式測定，青海省玉樹州雜多縣周六（24日）下午4時39分，發生黎克特制5.3級地震。暫未收到人命傷亡及建築物損毀報告。</p><p>震央與西藏接壤地區極為接近，震源深度為10公里。西藏那曲市巴青縣周四（22日）晚10時33分發生7級地震，造成至少16人遇難。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:42:48.469650+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:10.756630+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:38:19.358601+00:00","content_hash":"fdc41b0139a76315f29b7b9be014d1b27db54010db8a605c01dcf4f651fb36d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}